<Layout title="Blossoms of the Spring" description="Blossoms of the Spring - The holy letters of Rabbi Yisroel Odesser (Saba)">
  <div class="book-page">
    <header class="book-header">
      <h1>Blossoms of the Spring</h1>
      <h2>נקודות טובות - Nekudos Tovos</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">The Holy Letters of Rabbi Yisroel Odesser (Saba)</p>
    </header>

    <div class="intro-section">
      <p><strong>Blossoms of the Spring</strong> (Nekudos Tovos) contains the holy letters written by Rabbi Yisroel Odesser, known as Saba Yisroel, the key bearer of the Breslov tradition who revealed the <em>Na Nach Nachma Nachman Me'Uman</em> petek.</p>
      <p>These letters are called "blossoms of the stream" - flowing waters of wisdom from the holy wellsprings of Rabbi Nachman's teachings, transmitted through his faithful student Rabbi Yisroel Odesser.</p>
      <p class="quote">"Na Nach Nachma Nachman Me'Uman"</p>
    </div>

